% The Council finds the record does not show the practitioner concluded that
% Kim was trained: no prescription states the supplies and the testing
% frequency. Not reasonable and necessary.
scenario training_unsupported is:
    claim 1 is for the glucose monitor.
    the HCPCS code of the glucose monitor is "E0607".
    the glucose monitor is furnished to Kim.
    the diagnosis code of Kim is "E11.9".
    the finding trained on blood glucose monitor about Kim is unsupported, according to the Council, because "the record contains no prescription for supplies stating a frequency of blood glucose testing".
    rn expects answers [].
